    "other_lines": "GT White/Pink/Nonomimi Sangria (GTCC-WHI-SAN-1L, GTCC-PIN-SAN-1L, GTCC-NON-SAN-1L, GTCC-NON-SAN-3.85L) are ACTIVE Shopify cocktails that are NOT MUZA-branded. Out of scope."
